WEBVTT

00:11:02.366 --> 00:11:05.494
It's essentially like a perfect
storm in the making.

00:11:06.203 --> 00:11:07.413
Corruption,

00:11:07.454 --> 00:11:10.541
institutional and socioeconomic fragility,

00:11:10.582 --> 00:11:13.627
climate disruptions
and environmental plundering,

00:11:13.669 --> 00:11:15.546
all acting as a backdrop

00:11:15.587 --> 00:11:17.798
to a competition to gain
access to the minerals

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:19.717
that we need in order to decarbonize.

00:11:20.384 --> 00:11:23.470
All of these factors will be magnified

00:11:23.512 --> 00:11:26.056
if we don't rein in
the scramble for resources.

00:11:26.515 --> 00:11:29.351
All of them will reinforce one another.

00:11:29.977 --> 00:11:32.688
And I want to make something
very clear here.